# Implementation Plan - Migrate DevFluent to React

This plan outlines the technical steps to port the DevFluent Single Page Application (SPA) into React using Vite. We will implement modular React components to manage pages, tabs, authentication states, booking calendar, commerce shopping cart, security checkouts (Stripe/MTN/Orange MoMo), simulated AI drawer, Web Terminal simulator, and daily streak persistence.

We will preserve the exact visual aesthetics, style properties, gradients, and custom responsive layouts defined in [index.css](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/index.css) by importing it directly into our React component tree.

## Proposed Changes

We will introduce a standard Vite + React project configuration in the workspace:

### Configuration & Project Toolchain
*   `[NEW]` [package.json](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/package.json) - Defines npm packages: `react`, `react-dom` as dependencies, and `vite`, `@vitejs/plugin-react` as devDependencies. Also lists start/build scripts.
*   `[NEW]` [vite.config.js](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/vite.config.js) - Configurations for the Vite bundler with `@vitejs/plugin-react`.
*   `[MODIFY]` [index.html](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/index.html) - Adapt the HTML to render `<div id="root"></div>` for React mounting, keeping the ambient glowing background decoration and removing the hardcoded layout which is moving to React.

### React Component Architecture
We will structure our application in the `src/` directory:
*   `[NEW]` [src/main.jsx](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/src/main.jsx) - Project bootstrapping script mounting React to the `#root` element.
*   `[NEW]` [src/App.jsx](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/src/App.jsx) - Main layout coordination. Houses global application state and renders sub-layouts.
*   `[NEW]` [src/components/Sidebar.jsx](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/src/components/Sidebar.jsx) - Navigation panel managing pages switching.
*   `[NEW]` [src/components/Header.jsx](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/src/components/Header.jsx) - Header area containing content search filter, light/dark theme toggler, offline mode toggler, and user profile session widget.
*   `[NEW]` [src/pages/Home.jsx](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/src/pages/Home.jsx) - Renders lessons, rating controls, simulated video timelines tracker, comments guild discuss panel, and interactive Javascript sandbox editor compiler.
*   `[NEW]` [src/pages/About.jsx](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/src/pages/About.jsx) - Product concepts visual slides summary.
*   `[NEW]` [src/pages/Services.jsx](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/src/pages/Services.jsx) - Reservation booking scheduler calendar.
*   `[NEW]` [src/pages/Shop.jsx](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/src/pages/Shop.jsx) - E-commerce dev listings store and active checkout panel.
*   `[NEW]` [src/pages/Contact.jsx](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/src/pages/Contact.jsx) - Form dispatcher details.
*   `[NEW]` [src/pages/Settings.jsx](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/src/pages/Settings.jsx) - WordPress-style layout CMS updater input blocks, and profile settings.
*   `[NEW]` [src/pages/Profile.jsx](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/src/pages/Profile.jsx) - Auth tab widgets (Login/Signup/Reset) and logged user statistics logs dashboard.
*   `[NEW]` [src/components/CheckoutModal.jsx](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/src/components/CheckoutModal.jsx) - Transact auth forms for Stripe or African MoMo options.
*   `[NEW]` [src/components/AIDrawer.jsx](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/src/components/AIDrawer.jsx) - Floating helper chat query module (supports French, English, and Google backlinks).

### Clean-Up
*   `[DELETE]` [app.js](file:///c:/Users/NICK%20TECH/prompt/app.js) - Removed since all logic is migrated into the React components.

